         <property name="html">
          <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Arial'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:8px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Método de la Bisección&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1.1. ¿Para qué sirve?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método de la bisección es un algoritmo numérico utilizado para encontrar raíces reales (ceros) de ecuaciones no lineales de la forma:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) = 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Se emplea cuando no es posible o resulta demasiado complejo despejar la variable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; de forma analítica (por ejemplo, en ecuaciones trascendentes como &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;−&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:super;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; − cos(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) = 0).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1.2. Fundamento Matemático&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;El método se basa en el Teorema de Bolzano (un caso particular del Teorema del Valor Intermedio). Si una función &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) es continua en un intervalo cerrado [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;] y los valores en sus extremos tienen signos opuestos, es decir:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) · &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) &amp;lt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;entonces existe al menos una raíz &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; ∈ (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) tal que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) = 0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:11pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1.3. Fórmulas Principales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Cálculo del punto medio (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; En cada iteración &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, el intervalo actual [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;] se divide exactamente a la mitad:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; =      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:3px; margin-right:3px;&quot; align=&quot;center&quot; cellspacing=&quot;2&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot; vertical-align:middle; padding-left:4; padding-right:4; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; + &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot; vertical-align:middle; padding-left:4; padding-right:4; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:11pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cambria Math,Times New Roman,serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:600; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2. Criterio de selección del nuevo subintervalo:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Se evalúa &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) y se actualiza el intervalo para la siguiente iteración (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; font-style:italic; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; + 1):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;square&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Si &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;) = 0 entonces &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; es la raíz exacta y el proceso termina.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:4px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Si &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;) · &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;) &amp;lt; 0, la raíz está en la mitad izquierda: &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;+1&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; y &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;+1&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:6px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Si &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;) · &lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-style:italic; vertical-align:sub;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;) &amp;gt; 0, la raíz está en la mitad derecha: &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </item>
      </layout>
     </item>
    </layout>
   </item>
